TEXT 320 112 Left 3 ;KITTICOPTER THREE-OP-AMP CONTROLLER  |  Kp ~= 0.01432 V/V
TEXT 320 152 Left 2 ;Plant: 14.2748/[s(8.1s+1)]    Sensor: 0.93 V/m    Hardware op-amps: 741, +/-15 V
TEXT 352 216 Left 2 ;U1: subtract and attenuate x0.01
TEXT 936 216 Left 2 ;U2: non-inverting gain x1.47
TEXT 1488 216 Left 2 ;U3: add calibrated +2.5 V bias
TEXT 352 448 Left 2 ;U1_OUT = 0.01*(VREF - VSENSE)
TEXT 936 448 Left 2 ;U2_OUT = 1.47*U1_OUT
TEXT 1488 448 Left 2 ;V(COMMAND) ~= 2.5 + 0.01432*(VREF - VSENSE)
TEXT 64 504 Left 2 ;DAQ / bench test sources
TEXT 80 672 Left 2 ;DAC-1 setpoint: 4.65 V for 5 m
TEXT 80 704 Left 2 ;DAC-0 / ADC-2 sensor feedback: 4.65 V at 5 m
TEXT 64 768 Left 2 ;Power rails
TEXT 392 568 Left 2 ;100 nF decoupling at EACH op-amp: VCC->GND and VEE->GND
TEXT 608 736 Left 2 ;BIAS POTENTIOMETER NETWORK
TEXT 608 768 Left 2 ;R11=3.9k to GND, P1=10k, R12=1.2k shunt across P1, R13=22k to -15 V
TEXT 608 1152 Left 2 ;P1 is represented by P1_TOP + P1_BOT.  W=0 is top end; W=1 is bottom end.
TEXT 608 1184 Left 2 ;Nominal calibrated setting W=0.7830806 gives WIPER ~= -2.500 V when VREF=VSENSE=4.65 V.
TEXT 1184 760 Left 2 ;CALIBRATION
TEXT 1184 792 Left 2 ;1) Set VREF = VSENSE = 4.650 V.
TEXT 1184 824 Left 2 ;2) Adjust W (hardware: P1) until V(COMMAND) = +2.500 V.
TEXT 1184 856 Left 2 ;3) Keep P1 fixed during tracking.
TEXT 1184 888 Left 2 ;The 1.2k shunt narrows the pot range and the finite loading gives Kp ~= 0.0143219 V/V.
TEXT 1184 952 Left 2 ;741 hardware pin reminder: pin 7=+15 V, pin 4=-15 V; pins 1, 5 and 8 unused.
TEXT 1184 984 Left 2 ;UniversalOpamp2 is used here with approximate 741 dynamics so the schematic runs without an external model.
TEXT 1184 1056 Left 2 !.param W=0.7830806
TEXT 1184 1088 Left 2 !.op
